Subject: SOP Multi-Target Semantic Compiler Document Role Compatibility

Description: WS-CTPR-002 semantic compatibility contract that keeps valid SOP data, definitions, policies, profiles, tests, proofs, and narratives from acquiring execution authority merely because SOP gains an explicit multi-target compiler purpose.

